  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who hold or are perceived to hold Muslim sympathies, as the meme directly addresses them with the text 'you think by being a muslim sympathizer...'. The meme is designed to provoke and insult this group by implying they are foolish for thinking their sympathies will protect them from violence, thereby targeting those who identify with or support Muslim communities. The racialized nature of the insult ('you are a special kind of stupid') also suggests the meme is aimed at audiences who are either anti-Black or who hold racist views, as it uses the Black man's race to amplify the insult. The overall intent is to dehumanize and incite hatred toward Muslim sympathizers, making the target audience those who might be perceived as vulnerable to such rhetoric or who are already part of a hostile discourse toward Muslims.",
